- `node --test src/review-task.test.js` exits 0 and the output contains two lines matching the test names "NON_IMPL gate: staleness_audit (advisoryProse) short prose is NOT flagged" and "NON_IMPL gate: non-exempt source short prose IS flagged", both marked passing.
